('Law & Legal Services', 'Litigation Lawyer', 'litigation-lawyer',
'Represent clients in courts across civil, criminal, constitutional, and administrative matters.',
'Litigation remains one of the most respected and financially rewarding careers for those with legal education. For UPSC aspirants with a law degree, the transition is natural — your knowledge of constitutional law, administrative law, and public policy is a direct asset in High Court and Supreme Court practice.',
'[{"stage":"Entry","title":"Junior Associate / Apprentice","years":"0-3","salary":"₹3-8 LPA","responsibilities":["Legal research","Drafting pleadings and applications","Court appearances for procedural matters","File management"]},{"stage":"Mid","title":"Associate Advocate","years":"3-7","salary":"₹8-20 LPA","responsibilities":["Independent case handling","Client counseling","Drafting complex pleadings","Negotiation and settlements"]},{"stage":"Senior","title":"Senior Advocate / Partner","years":"7-15","salary":"₹20-80 LPA","responsibilities":["Senior court appearances","Practice management","Mentoring juniors","Business development"]},{"stage":"Leadership","title":"Senior Advocate / Independent Practice","years":"15+","salary":"₹80 LPA+","responsibilities":["Supreme Court practice","High-profile cases","Academic contributions","Chambers leadership"]}]',
'₹3-8 LPA', '₹8-20 LPA', '₹80 LPA+',
ARRAY['Prestige', 'Flexible practice structure', 'Intellectual challenge', 'High earning potential', 'Social impact opportunity'],
'Defend constitutional rights, challenge arbitrary government action, and ensure access to justice. Constitutional litigation can create precedents that affect millions.',
'Work with Supreme Court and High Court judges, senior advocates, and constitutional law giants.',
'LLB degree. Enrollment with Bar Council. UPSC preparation enhances constitutional and administrative law knowledge significantly.',
ARRAY['Legal research', 'Drafting', 'Oral advocacy', 'Case analysis', 'Client management', 'Constitutional law', 'Procedural law'],
'UPSC preparation provides exceptional grounding in constitutional law (Fundamental Rights, DPSPs, federal structure), administrative law, and judicial review — all core areas of litigation practice. Your essay writing directly translates to brief writing.',
4, 'Stable with high growth at senior levels',
'[{"name":"Constitutional Law (India)","provider":"NLSIU Bangalore","url":"https://www.nls.ac.in","cost":"₹5,000","duration":"3 months"},{"name":"Legal Drafting and Advocacy","provider":"Bar Council of India Trust","url":"https://www.barcouncilofindia.org","cost":"₹3,000","duration":"4 weeks"}]',
ARRAY['Enrollment with State Bar Council', 'Advocate-on-Record (AOR) Supreme Court'],
ARRAY['Draft 5 writ petitions on constitutional issues', 'Research brief on a landmark SC judgment', 'Case summary of recent constitutional bench decisions'],
'[{"week":1,"title":"Bar Council Enrollment","tasks":["Complete Bar Council enrollment if pending","Register with local bar association","Research senior advocates to approach for apprenticeship","Study CPC and CrPC fundamentals"]},{"week":2,"title":"Find a Senior Advocate","tasks":["Approach 5 senior advocates in your target practice area","Write formal applications for apprenticeship","Network at bar association events","Attend court to observe proceedings"]},{"week":3,"title":"Constitutional Law Mastery","tasks":["Review all fundamental rights provisions in depth","Study landmark cases: Kesavananda Bharati, Maneka Gandhi, Vishaka","Draft a sample writ petition","Read recent SC constitutional bench judgments"]},{"week":4,"title":"Procedural Law","tasks":["Study Order 1-10 of CPC thoroughly","Understand writ jurisdiction under Articles 32 and 226","Practice drafting applications","Study rules of the High Court in your state"]},{"week":5,"title":"Legal Research Skills","tasks":["Learn SCC Online and Manupatra navigation","Practice finding precedents on specific issues","Learn to use AIR and ILR","Draft a legal research memo"]},{"week":6,"title":"Drafting Practice","tasks":["Draft a plaint in a civil matter","Draft a writ petition challenging administrative action","Draft a bail application","Draft a criminal complaint under specific IPC sections"]},{"week":7,"title":"Court Observation","tasks":["Attend Supreme Court / High Court for 5 days","Note advocacy techniques of senior advocates","Observe courtroom procedure","Build network at the courts"]},{"week":8,"title":"Specialization Choice","tasks":["Choose a practice area: constitutional, service, criminal, commercial","Read 10 leading cases in that area","Connect with specialists in that domain","Begin building domain expertise"]},{"week":9,"title":"Junior Brief Work","tasks":["Take up small brief work for fees","Attend brief hearings independently","Build confidence in court appearances","Network with fellow junior advocates"]},{"week":10,"title":"Digital Presence","tasks":["Create a simple LinkedIn profile as advocate","Write on legal issues on Twitter or LinkedIn","Engage with legal commentary","Build reputation as a thoughtful voice"]},{"week":11,"title":"Administrative Law Focus","tasks":["Deep study of judicial review principles","Study CAT (Central Administrative Tribunal) jurisdiction","Research service law cases","Practice drafting OAs in CAT matters"]},{"week":12,"title":"Build Practice Foundation","tasks":["Set up basic practice infrastructure","Create fee structures for junior work","Join 2 bar committees","Set 1-year practice development goals"]}]',
'₹5,000-15,000 (bar enrollment, law books)',
'Enroll with State Bar Council. Approach senior advocates for apprenticeship — preferably those specializing in constitutional, administrative, or service law where your UPSC knowledge is most relevant.',
'[{"title":"Bar & Bench","url":"https://www.youtube.com/@barandbench","channel":"Bar & Bench"},{"title":"Live Law","url":"https://www.youtube.com/@LiveLawIndia","channel":"Live Law India"}]',
'[{"title":"Legally Speaking","url":"https://www.youtube.com/@legallyspeaking","host":"Legal professionals"}]',
ARRAY['Bar Council of India', 'Supreme Court Bar Association', 'High Court Bar Association']),

('Law & Legal Services', 'Corporate Legal Counsel', 'corporate-legal-counsel',
'Provide in-house legal advice to companies on contracts, compliance, M&A, and regulatory matters.',
'Corporate counsel roles in large companies offer excellent compensation, structured work, and the ability to shape business decisions. For UPSC aspirants with law degrees, corporate law is an excellent alternative to litigation — better work-life balance, higher early-career salaries, and exposure to complex business transactions.',
'[{"stage":"Entry","title":"Junior Legal Counsel / Legal Associate","years":"0-3","salary":"₹6-12 LPA","responsibilities":["Contract review and drafting","Regulatory compliance support","Legal research","Internal advisory"]},{"stage":"Mid","title":"Legal Manager / Senior Counsel","years":"3-7","salary":"₹12-25 LPA","responsibilities":["Contract negotiations","Compliance programs","M&A support","Litigation management"]},{"stage":"Senior","title":"Senior Legal Director","years":"7-12","salary":"₹25-60 LPA","responsibilities":["Legal strategy","Board advisory","GC support","Team management"]},{"stage":"Leadership","title":"General Counsel","years":"12+","salary":"₹60-150 LPA","responsibilities":["Legal department leadership","Board member","Corporate governance","Risk management"]}]',
'₹6-12 LPA', '₹12-25 LPA', '₹60-150 LPA',
ARRAY['High salary', 'Work-life balance vs litigation', 'Corporate benefits', 'Business exposure', 'Stable income'],
