bility groups","Build retention systems"]},{"week":10,"title":"Partnerships","tasks":["Collaborate with 2 other UPSC creators","Joint live sessions to cross-promote audiences","Affiliate marketing for relevant products","Approach study material companies for partnerships"]},{"week":11,"title":"Systems and Delegation","tasks":["Hire one video editor (₹10,000-15,000/month)","Create content templates to speed production","Document your processes","Start thinking about your first full-time hire"]},{"week":12,"title":"Revenue Review","tasks":["Calculate monthly revenue and set 6-month targets","Evaluate product portfolio","Plan next major course or product","Define your 1-crore/year roadmap"]}]',
