g tie-ups","Partner with NGOs working with UPSC aspirants","Connect with school and college career cells","Offer group sessions to coaching institutes"]},{"week":10,"title":"Group Coaching","tasks":["Launch a 4-week group career transition program","Price at ₹3,000-8,000 per person","Recruit first 5-10 participants","Build testimonials and case studies"]},{"week":11,"title":"Scale","tasks":["Hire one assistant for admin","Create automated assessments","Build referral program from happy clients","Plan first cohort program"]},{"week":12,"title":"Sustainable Practice","tasks":["Evaluate revenue and time investment","Set pricing for next 6 months","Plan book or comprehensive guide","Build media presence through podcasts and articles"]}]',
